# GLO > MIDI > CLOCK SOURCE (a74; a75 saves it in the bt byte): AUTO (the default), INTERNAL, EXTERNAL. The row is the first row of MIDI.
wait 300
expect clksrc 0
tap GLO
# GLOBAL opens its sections; SEL enters MIDI + CLOCK (CLOCK SOURCE is row 0)
tap SEL
shot 01_glo_clock_source.png
turn ALGO 2
expect clksrc 2
shot 02_glo_external.png
tap GLO
wait 100
expect clkext 1
# EXTERNAL: PLAY with no clock waits; the play arrow and the PLAY light blink, the top line says so
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
tap PLAY
wait 700
expect playing 1
expect waiting 1
expect msgwait 1
shot 03_waiting_for_clock.png
leds
expect clocks_out 0
expect transport_out 0
midi F8 00 00
wait 18
midi F8 00 00
